Changes in the initial VierTech fork:
- package renamed to @viertech/wb
- repository/package metadata changed to VierTech
- direct @neoxr/api dependency removed
- NeoxrApi public export removed
- source map build artifacts removed
- documentation and publish workflow replaced for the VierTech fork

Compatibility note:
@neoxr/helper is intentionally retained in this first compatibility fork because
the distributed core is obfuscated and may resolve helper functionality dynamically.
It should only be removed after runtime compatibility tests or replacement.


VierTech API integration:
The fork uses @viertech/api as its API client package. The old direct
@neoxr/api public client is not included in the VierTech fork.


StickerPack and Poll additions:
The clean StickerPack helper and generic Poll helper in the VierTech fork were
adapted from VierBot application-side implementations and integrated as
VierTech-maintained package features.
